  "name": "BBQ Chuck Roast",
  "subtitle": "Slow-roasted beef with savory barbecue sauce",
  "description": "Chuck roast is marinated in a beer-enriched barbecue and teriyaki mixture, then roasted until tender and safely cooked.",
